stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed : Staff sets, randomises or imports a code (FR-INV-04)
  Proposed --> Active : confirmed on the lock, the previous code retires (FR-INV-04)
  Proposed --> DcCancelled : Staff cancels the proposal (FR-INV-04)
  Active --> Retired : a new code becomes active (FR-INV-04)
  DcCancelled : Cancelled
